TITLE Mn(3) in solution at 100C, pH 5, Ba 0.1 mol/kgw, eq with talc+rhodochrosite+sepiolite+Pb(OH)2
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH   5 charge
    units mol/kgw
    Ba   0.1
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Talc            0 10
    Rhodochrosite   0 10
    Sepiolite       0 10
    Sepiolite(d)    0 10
    Pb(OH)2         0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -totals Mn(3)
END
